  WrittenDialogue: "So much for telling the truth! The justice system cares more about confidence than facts.\nThe best they could do was a 20 year plea deal even after I cried in court.\nI guess I’m not as pretty as I thought.\nMaybe if I keep to myself I can entirely avoid being a prison bitch.\nWait but fuck that, I’m just playing to not lose.\nI gotta be tough! No one’s gonna mess with me.\nLet’s show ‘em who’s boss!"
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY"
